WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.611
[Cold Ambient Drone Cuts to Clean Hopeful Piano Motif]

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:15.500
Open the door, room two four teen

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.236
My arms are full of bags

00:00:18.877 --> 00:00:21.500
But I'm not the first one here

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.821
Someone's in the bed

00:00:23.821 --> 00:00:26.800
His pillows and his blankets

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.486
He's already fast asleep

00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:33.000
I must have the wrong room

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.613
My heart begins to leap...

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:47.200
I check the card upon the door

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.454
My stomach's in a knot

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:52.800
"Aubrie Jean Kelly"

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.916
"Madison Elizabeth Scott"

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:59.000
And "Aubrey Jordan Fuller"

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.058
A clerical mistake

00:01:02.058 --> 00:01:05.500
The boy in bed begins to stir

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.781
He's starting to awake...

00:01:13.559 --> 00:01:22.000
He sits up, and I see his eyes

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.500
And I'm not scared at all

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:33.498
He just looks lost and terrified

00:01:34.078 --> 00:01:40.000
He looks so... small

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.500
My mind just goes completely clear

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:52.073
A feeling I can't place

00:01:52.713 --> 00:01:56.000
It's the first time that I've ever seen

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Such kindness in a face

00:02:15.751 --> 00:02:20.076
A new light switching on...

00:02:20.076 --> 00:02:30.515
[Piano and Strings Interlude]

00:02:30.515 --> 00:02:33.500
The noise outside the hallway

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.000
Is suddenly too much

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.500
He's rocking in his wheelchair

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.500
He's trembling at my touch

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.500
"He's not angry. He's overwhelmed."

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.725
I know just what he needs

00:02:50.965 --> 00:02:54.000
He needs a quiet anchor

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.500
A place where he can breathe

00:02:59.894 --> 00:03:06.436
He sits up, and I see his eyes

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:14.599
And I'm not scared at all

00:03:15.519 --> 00:03:19.500
He just looks lost and terrified

00:03:20.269 --> 00:03:26.000
He looks so... small

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:32.317
My mind just goes completely clear

00:03:32.697 --> 00:03:39.882
This feeling I can't place

00:03:39.942 --> 00:03:45.000
It's the first time that I've ever seen

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:52.000
Such kindness in a face

00:04:01.355 --> 00:04:05.879
A new light switching on...

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:20.500
"It's okay. Focus on my voice."

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.500
"You're safe."

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:34.600
A new light...
